OL,3,GNEWSAWRU staff are now safer at work
OL,4,Aafter 'toxic' culture changes, says
OL,5,Awatchdog
OL,6,
OL,7,FRugby players, coaches and staff are
OL,8,Fnow safer working at the Welsh Rugby
OL,9,FUnion (WRU) after changes were made
OL,10,Ffollowing "toxic" culture findings,
OL,11,Faccording to an equality watchdog.
OL,13,FThe Equality and Human Rights
OL,14,FCommission (EHRC) said the union had
OL,15,F"put in the hard yards" and made
OL,16,Fimprovements to the way it handled
OL,17,Fharassment and discrimination.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
