OL,3,GNEWSAWRU staff are now safer at work
OL,4,Aafter 'toxic' culture changes, says
OL,5,Awatchdog
OL,6,
OL,7,FA BBC Wales Investigates programme in
OL,8,F2023 uncovered allegations of sexism
OL,9,Fand misogyny at the WRU, prompting an
OL,10,Findependent investigation which backed
OL,11,Fup the claims.
OL,13,FThe WRU said it had "introduced a
OL,14,Fseries of proactive measures" to
OL,15,Fimprove its culture.
